HOST: https://api.example.com
# Test API
# Group X
## Stuff [/stuff/{id}{?q}]
+ Parameters
    + id: `8c6e` (string, required) - Path UUID.
    + q: hi (string, optional) - Free-text query.
    + traceId: abc123 (string, optional) - `[header:X-Trace-Id]` Distributed-trace id, sent on every request.
    + sessionId: sess1 (string, optional) - `[cookie]` Authentication cookie.
### Get Stuff [GET]
+ Response 200
